WEBVTT

01:29.320 --> 01:34.350
[Never-Ending Summer]

01:35.840 --> 01:37.890
[Episode 8]

01:38.640 --> 01:39.900
Why are you zoning out?

01:40.270 --> 01:41.520
Call him brother.

01:50.000 --> 01:50.530
Brother.

01:59.580 --> 02:00.310
I'm leaving.

02:03.590 --> 02:04.260
Come back.

02:08.000 --> 02:09.180
So rude.

02:12.310 --> 02:12.950
Sit down.

02:22.490 --> 02:24.070
Why do I feel like

02:25.190 --> 02:26.590
you guys know each other?

02:26.870 --> 02:28.870
Are you classmates?

02:30.720 --> 02:32.400
We used to...

02:32.430 --> 02:33.079
Not close.

02:35.730 --> 02:36.910
Since you don't go to school every day,

02:36.910 --> 02:38.110
no wonder you don't know anyone.

02:38.110 --> 02:38.820
You have no idea

02:38.820 --> 02:40.150
how good her grades are.

02:40.960 --> 02:42.100
It's a pity that

02:42.910 --> 02:45.310
she didn't take the college entrance exam.

02:45.590 --> 02:46.470
Here is the thing.

02:46.470 --> 02:48.480
She has been in poor health
since childhood.

02:48.480 --> 02:50.480
She had a fever on the day of the exam,

02:50.560 --> 02:51.560
which affected

02:51.560 --> 02:52.930
her score.

02:54.220 --> 02:55.570
She also plans to...

02:55.600 --> 02:56.860
I will retake the exam.

02:59.000 --> 03:00.260
Auntie Guo promised me

03:00.310 --> 03:01.750
that she would support me

03:02.450 --> 03:04.180
until I graduate from college.

03:05.430 --> 03:06.270
Yes.

03:06.840 --> 03:08.550
I found

03:08.580 --> 03:10.200
a cram school in the northern suburbs.

03:10.200 --> 03:11.690
She will be leaving soon.

03:12.740 --> 03:14.770
My sister-in-law, you are so kind.

03:14.900 --> 03:16.630
I really couldn't tell before.

03:17.130 --> 03:18.340
In that case,

03:18.520 --> 03:19.870
Zhou Wan will retake the exam,

03:19.870 --> 03:22.730
and Xixiao will prepare to
apply to the art academy.

03:23.070 --> 03:25.120
Why don't you stay at our place?

03:26.270 --> 03:28.320
Xixiao never pays much
attention to his studies.

03:28.320 --> 03:29.490
You can stay by his side

03:29.490 --> 03:30.950
and be a role model for him.

03:33.760 --> 03:34.560
No, thank you.

03:35.100 --> 03:37.100
I... I am

03:37.120 --> 03:39.200
more used to being alone.

03:39.829 --> 03:40.480
Yeah.

03:40.920 --> 03:42.340
Don't make it difficult for her.

03:42.340 --> 03:44.050
She's afraid of being a burden.

03:44.050 --> 03:45.780
She's under too much pressure.

03:47.850 --> 03:49.180
I think it's a good idea.

03:51.520 --> 03:52.710
After all, I have a lot

03:52.710 --> 03:53.710
to learn from you.

03:53.840 --> 03:54.430
Really?

04:00.110 --> 04:01.550
Look, Xixiao has agreed to it.

04:01.550 --> 04:02.080
What else are you

04:02.080 --> 04:02.960
shy about?

04:03.520 --> 04:04.360
Ms. Chen,

04:05.040 --> 04:06.590
please clean up

04:06.590 --> 04:07.730
Xixiao's childhood room.

04:07.730 --> 04:08.590
It's just that in his room,

04:08.590 --> 04:09.830
there are many paintings
he drew when he was a kid,

04:09.830 --> 04:10.830
so the walls are a bit messy.

04:10.830 --> 04:12.030
Please don't mind it.

04:13.610 --> 04:16.000
Then, I'll give you a year.

04:16.709 --> 04:17.350
But

04:18.040 --> 04:19.230
your mother's school

04:19.230 --> 04:20.490
is not easy to get into.

04:20.519 --> 04:21.579
Are you confident?

04:22.010 --> 04:22.570
Yes.

04:25.980 --> 04:27.080
I'm telling you, Lu Xixiao,

04:27.080 --> 04:28.130
if you cause

04:28.150 --> 04:29.290
any trouble

04:29.960 --> 04:30.710
at home

04:30.710 --> 04:32.200
this year,

04:32.640 --> 04:34.120
don't pretend

04:34.120 --> 04:34.760
in front of me

04:34.760 --> 04:36.150
that you are preparing thoroughly.

04:36.150 --> 04:36.880
Understand?

04:36.880 --> 04:38.200
Just go abroad

04:38.200 --> 04:39.320
and study finance.

04:39.930 --> 04:41.130
Can you promise that?

04:41.970 --> 04:42.680
Okay.

04:45.260 --> 04:46.030
Alright.

04:47.290 --> 04:48.350
Then it's settled.

04:49.930 --> 04:51.140
Let's eat.

05:08.030 --> 05:09.140
Who are you waiting for?

05:09.140 --> 05:10.140
Go play your game.

05:18.050 --> 05:18.960
From now on,

05:18.960 --> 05:20.320
you'll be living together every day.

05:20.320 --> 05:21.230
Why did you make things so awkward

05:21.230 --> 05:22.160
between you two?

05:22.680 --> 05:23.000
What?

05:23.000 --> 05:23.560
I said,

05:23.560 --> 05:24.230
since you'll be

05:24.230 --> 05:25.310
living together every day,

05:25.310 --> 05:27.110
why did you make things awkward?

05:32.890 --> 05:34.290
Let me ask you something.

05:35.450 --> 05:36.720
If one day

05:38.070 --> 05:39.670
Gu Meng becomes your sister,

05:40.710 --> 05:41.540
what can you do?

05:41.540 --> 05:42.350
What else can I do?

05:42.350 --> 05:43.680
Get along well with her.

05:44.030 --> 05:45.080
Besides, Gu Meng and I

05:45.080 --> 05:46.680
are not like you and Zhou Wan.

05:47.150 --> 05:48.350
We are very special.

05:48.350 --> 05:49.520
We have a deep bond.

05:49.790 --> 05:50.960
What kind of bond do you two have?

05:50.960 --> 05:51.890
Tell me about it.

05:53.070 --> 05:54.880
Do you know how many times Gu Meng

05:54.909 --> 05:56.770
wrote my name in that notebook?

05:56.880 --> 05:58.270
Fifty-seven times.

05:58.290 --> 06:00.320
Fifty-seven times, man.

06:00.760 --> 06:02.020
Do you know what that means?

06:02.020 --> 06:03.420
She will never forget me.

06:05.280 --> 06:06.390
I sometimes really admire

06:06.390 --> 06:07.520
your way of thinking.

06:07.520 --> 06:08.410
Really.

06:08.740 --> 06:10.510
You can deceive yourself.

06:11.370 --> 06:13.170
I could never be so blind anyway.

06:13.550 --> 06:15.330
You're not blind?

06:15.410 --> 06:16.120
I think deep down,

06:16.120 --> 06:17.850
you're probably pretty happy.

06:21.250 --> 06:22.900
What? Say that again.

06:23.150 --> 06:23.710
Never mind.

06:23.710 --> 06:24.680
Okay.

06:29.720 --> 06:31.410
You haven't finished, Wan.

06:31.790 --> 06:32.440
What's the situation

06:32.440 --> 06:33.680
between you two now?

06:34.200 --> 06:35.270
Grandma is in the hospital,

06:35.270 --> 06:36.960
and she's always worried about my safety.

06:36.960 --> 06:37.640
Anyway, that place

06:37.640 --> 06:39.100
is closer to the hospital.

06:39.150 --> 06:40.560
Who's asking about that?

06:40.580 --> 06:42.090
I mean you and Lu Xixiao.

06:42.590 --> 06:43.560
You also added each other

06:43.560 --> 06:44.520
back on WeChat.

06:45.080 --> 06:46.710
He even let you go to his house.

06:46.710 --> 06:47.320
Why are you two

06:47.320 --> 06:48.120
at odds again?

06:49.320 --> 06:50.650
It's a bit complicated.

06:53.590 --> 06:54.450
Tell us more.

06:59.720 --> 07:01.200
The aunt who

07:02.230 --> 07:03.360
sponsored me before

07:04.030 --> 07:05.200
is his stepmother.

07:06.280 --> 07:07.410
He doesn't like her.

07:07.790 --> 07:08.390
Our friendship

07:08.390 --> 07:09.920
wasn't pure from the start.

07:11.590 --> 07:12.390
Then, what exactly is

07:12.390 --> 07:13.720
your relationship now?

07:13.880 --> 07:14.910
Roommates?

07:14.910 --> 07:15.840
Sworn siblings?

07:16.440 --> 07:17.150
Your relationship is

07:17.150 --> 07:18.320
more dramatic than the soap operas

07:18.320 --> 07:19.080
my mom watched.

07:19.080 --> 07:20.190
All right.

07:20.390 --> 07:21.650
We should head out now.

07:23.780 --> 07:24.760
He probably doesn't want

07:24.760 --> 07:25.890
to see me now either.

07:25.980 --> 07:27.710
Then, why did he let you go over?

07:28.910 --> 07:29.960
If it's a misunderstanding,

07:29.960 --> 07:31.320
then, clear it up.

07:31.480 --> 07:32.710
If you really did something wrong,

07:32.710 --> 07:33.780
then apologize properly.

07:33.780 --> 07:35.190
It's simple.

07:35.350 --> 07:36.040
You must...

07:37.120 --> 07:38.830
You scared me to death. Are you crazy?

07:38.830 --> 07:39.710
Weren't we going to watch a movie?

07:39.710 --> 07:40.390
Let's go.

07:41.030 --> 07:42.880
I told you to wait for me at the cinema.

07:42.880 --> 07:44.760
I was going straight there
from Zhou Wan's place.

07:44.760 --> 07:45.920
Why go through all this trouble?

07:45.920 --> 07:46.980
Look, what's this?

07:47.590 --> 07:48.650
Look, what's that?

07:48.850 --> 07:50.520
I specifically rode my bike
to pick you up.

07:50.520 --> 07:51.560
So handsome.

07:51.580 --> 07:53.150
To save you from taking a taxi.

07:53.150 --> 07:53.890
Is it cool?

07:54.909 --> 07:55.760
Not bad, right?

07:55.760 --> 07:56.560
You guys go watch the movie.

07:56.560 --> 07:57.560
I'll leave first.

07:57.560 --> 07:58.000
Bye.

07:58.000 --> 07:58.270
Bye.

07:58.270 --> 07:58.760
Okay.

07:58.760 --> 08:00.220
Remember what I said, Wan.

08:08.850 --> 08:10.150
Let me carry that for you.

08:10.150 --> 08:10.520
No need.

08:10.520 --> 08:11.150
This way, please.

08:11.150 --> 08:11.750
Thank you.

08:46.290 --> 08:46.920
Here.

08:49.470 --> 08:50.440
I've packed

08:50.440 --> 08:51.510
all your luggage.

08:54.240 --> 08:56.420
What I said at the dinner table

08:56.870 --> 08:58.680
wasn't just for him.

08:58.970 --> 09:00.170
You know that, right?

09:00.990 --> 09:01.900
I know.

09:02.280 --> 09:02.760
Hurry.

09:04.560 --> 09:05.640
The wedding

09:05.750 --> 09:07.510
has to be postponed for now.

09:07.510 --> 09:08.280
Dad means

09:08.300 --> 09:10.960
we'll talk about it
after Xixiao leaves next year.

09:10.960 --> 09:11.850
In addition,

09:12.990 --> 09:13.710
as for you,

09:15.110 --> 09:16.750
you need to know your place

09:16.750 --> 09:18.230
in this family,

09:18.230 --> 09:19.100
since there are already

09:19.100 --> 09:20.990
too many people causing me trouble

09:20.990 --> 09:21.850
in this family.

09:24.990 --> 09:25.750
Got it.

09:30.510 --> 09:31.640
Remember to miss me.

09:38.950 --> 09:40.220
And your

09:41.400 --> 09:43.320
so-called younger daughter.

09:43.970 --> 09:44.970
Keep an eye on her.

09:58.250 --> 09:59.130
Slow down.

10:06.280 --> 10:07.350
This room

10:07.350 --> 10:09.210
doesn't have a private bathroom.

10:09.470 --> 10:10.870
The bathroom is outside.

10:10.910 --> 10:11.780
This is it.

10:12.580 --> 10:13.220
Thank you.

10:20.910 --> 10:22.120
Come in.

10:24.110 --> 10:25.560
If you need anything,

10:25.560 --> 10:26.830
just let me know.

10:27.620 --> 10:28.470
Thank you.

10:29.670 --> 10:31.120
Get some rest early.

10:31.260 --> 10:32.200
If you need anything,

10:32.200 --> 10:33.130
just ask me.

10:33.510 --> 10:34.280
Thanks for your help.

10:34.280 --> 10:34.760
Okay.

10:34.790 --> 10:36.390
Thank you for your hard work.

10:49.420 --> 10:50.560
Lu Xixiao.

10:51.680 --> 10:52.560
I didn't expect

10:53.050 --> 10:54.780
to get closer to your childhood

10:55.110 --> 10:56.500
this way.

11:58.620 --> 11:59.530
I... I didn't know

11:59.530 --> 12:00.660
someone was in here.

12:06.790 --> 12:07.960
Don't you have a private bathroom

12:07.960 --> 12:09.280
in your room?

12:10.770 --> 12:12.430
Are you bossing me around now?

12:13.640 --> 12:14.840
Are you done using it?

12:16.110 --> 12:18.410
Don't you think
you should come over and say hi

12:18.410 --> 12:19.810
since you've moved in?

12:23.240 --> 12:25.170
I thought you didn't want to see me.

12:25.760 --> 12:26.620
What about you?

12:30.160 --> 12:32.930
♪ I'mma take a frozen heart ♪

12:34.000 --> 12:36.020
♪ Someone's gonna make it ♪

12:36.620 --> 12:39.390
♪ In the building of my broken part ♪

12:40.870 --> 12:42.500
♪ Someone's gonna fix it ♪

12:43.980 --> 12:47.260
♪ I'm the only one guy
with the ten things crime ♪

12:47.990 --> 12:51.270
♪ I deserve a sanction in my mind ♪

12:53.530 --> 12:54.620
Do you want to see me?

12:53.530 --> 12:54.930
♪ Nescience doesn't mean ♪

12:54.960 --> 12:56.010
♪ That I can fly ♪

12:59.220 --> 13:01.540
♪ But I never seem to close ♪

13:01.560 --> 13:03.270
♪ The dormer lock ♪

13:04.240 --> 13:04.850
I

13:05.310 --> 13:07.090
didn't know things
would turn out like this.

13:06.010 --> 13:07.250
♪ Telling you how the sky above the roof ♪

13:07.280 --> 13:08.540
♪ Is full of stars ♪

13:09.360 --> 13:12.420
I didn't mean to make you unhappy.

13:15.360 --> 13:16.420
What's the result?

13:17.740 --> 13:18.830
Isn't it the same?

13:23.190 --> 13:24.830
Do you have time?

13:28.590 --> 13:29.320
Wan.

13:29.610 --> 13:31.410
Someone is using this bathroom.

13:31.730 --> 13:33.700
Go to my room and use mine.

13:38.750 --> 13:40.150
What are you waiting for?

13:41.200 --> 13:42.930
Your godmother is calling you,

13:43.620 --> 13:44.260
my sister.

13:55.510 --> 13:57.230
Is it fun for you to move in?

13:58.090 --> 13:59.210
Do you think

13:59.250 --> 14:00.710
you can scare me like this?

14:02.250 --> 14:03.280
Of course not.

14:04.080 --> 14:06.080
It's not like I chose to move in here.

14:06.840 --> 14:08.600
I just want to save Grandma.

14:09.440 --> 14:12.240
It's been a long time
since we were in the same room.

14:12.420 --> 14:13.920
Are you a little unused to me,

14:13.920 --> 14:14.800
your daughter?

14:31.690 --> 14:33.790
[Inpatient Building]

14:35.290 --> 14:36.560
Dinner is ready.

14:40.170 --> 14:40.770
Mom.

14:41.280 --> 14:42.810
I washed some fruit for you.

14:43.930 --> 14:44.400
Come on.

14:45.080 --> 14:46.010
Have some fruit.

14:48.070 --> 14:48.930
Well,

14:49.630 --> 14:50.350
Wan,

14:50.990 --> 14:52.040
Guo Yan and I

14:52.040 --> 14:53.880
haven't been in touch for over a decade.

14:53.880 --> 14:56.210
She sent
so many things to me all of a sudden

14:56.750 --> 14:58.040
I don't think it's proper.

14:58.040 --> 14:59.620
That's okay.

14:59.800 --> 15:02.160
Aren't we family, Mom?

15:04.240 --> 15:05.840
Since she wants to give them to you,

15:05.840 --> 15:07.100
just accept them.

15:09.400 --> 15:10.280
These past few years,

15:10.280 --> 15:11.800
Wan has really grown up.

15:12.030 --> 15:14.160
Mom, your cultivated her well.

15:15.480 --> 15:16.540
I brought you food.

15:20.060 --> 15:20.960
Let me help you take this out.

15:20.960 --> 15:21.510
No need.

15:21.510 --> 15:22.470
No need to do so.

15:22.470 --> 15:23.520
Let me do it.

15:23.590 --> 15:25.300
You're just making it worse.

15:25.320 --> 15:27.580
Take out the bowls and chopsticks for me.

15:28.280 --> 15:30.000
Mom, I'm leaving now.

15:43.710 --> 15:44.510
150,000 yuan.

15:45.560 --> 15:48.690
This is the money for
your grandma's medical treatment.

15:49.320 --> 15:51.580
A kidney transplant costs 300,000 yuan.

15:53.920 --> 15:55.080
This is only half.

15:56.960 --> 15:59.990
I have a condition for the other half.

16:06.490 --> 16:07.420
What condition?

16:09.630 --> 16:11.280
Don't you think

16:11.280 --> 16:12.440
a year is too long?

16:13.710 --> 16:15.310
To study finance,

16:15.340 --> 16:17.020
letting him go aboard

16:17.590 --> 16:19.390
at the end of this summer is good.

16:22.510 --> 16:24.000
You want him to leave quickly

16:24.000 --> 16:26.330
so you can marry into the Lu family,
right?

16:26.630 --> 16:28.320
Zhou Wan, I have plenty of ways to

16:28.320 --> 16:29.230
make him leave.

16:29.320 --> 16:30.320
But

16:30.470 --> 16:32.000
you have to do something.

16:38.050 --> 16:38.920
You want me to persuade him

16:38.920 --> 16:40.120
to leave this summer?

16:40.590 --> 16:41.310
Yes.

16:41.510 --> 16:42.640
That would be great.

16:42.920 --> 16:44.150
If you do it,

16:44.320 --> 16:46.320
the entire Lu family will thank you.

16:46.820 --> 16:47.960
After all, no one

16:47.960 --> 16:49.080
wants him to study art.

16:49.080 --> 16:50.810
I won't accept your condition.

16:51.280 --> 16:52.110
This money is what you

16:52.110 --> 16:53.510
were supposed to give me.

16:58.230 --> 17:00.160
Grandma needs medical treatment.

17:01.510 --> 17:03.030
Do you want to make a choice

17:03.110 --> 17:04.270
between your grandma

17:03.900 --> 17:04.790
[New Times Bank Transfer cheque]

17:04.270 --> 17:05.440
and Lu Xixiao?

17:06.960 --> 17:09.020
Grandma's illness is quite serious.

17:10.329 --> 17:11.970
She can't wait much longer.

17:12.670 --> 17:13.510
Aren't you afraid that

17:13.510 --> 17:14.560
I'll expose you first?

17:14.560 --> 17:15.400
Are you crazy, Guo Xiangling?

17:15.400 --> 17:16.680
Expose me for what?

17:16.880 --> 17:18.140
Go ahead and expose me.

17:18.230 --> 17:19.460
You would've said it if you wanted to.

17:19.460 --> 17:21.270
Lu Xixiao would have known by now.

17:21.270 --> 17:22.470
But he knows nothing.

17:23.410 --> 17:25.329
That's because you care about him.

17:25.329 --> 17:26.579
You are afraid he'd get hurt,

17:26.579 --> 17:28.380
so you chose to hide everything.

17:29.300 --> 17:29.950
Besides,

17:30.360 --> 17:31.470
if you kick me out,

17:31.470 --> 17:32.920
what good does it do for you?

17:32.920 --> 17:35.250
How can I give you money
if I don't have any?

17:36.300 --> 17:37.600
We are mother and daughter.

17:37.600 --> 17:39.080
We rise and fall together.

17:39.990 --> 17:41.520
Don't you understand that?

17:42.580 --> 17:43.710
He has the right to do

17:44.640 --> 17:46.220
whatever he wants to do or study.

17:46.220 --> 17:47.620
How can I change his mind?

17:48.020 --> 17:48.790
Not to mention this is

17:48.790 --> 17:50.120
what he wants to do most.

17:51.600 --> 17:53.600
I don't care what he wants to study.

17:54.930 --> 17:57.160
I just want him to go abroad
as soon as possible,

17:57.160 --> 17:58.690
so I can enter the Lu family.

17:58.870 --> 18:00.220
He has to leave.

18:02.210 --> 18:05.660
[New Times Bank Transfer cheque]

18:02.460 --> 18:05.540
You can't take this money for nothing.

18:18.970 --> 18:19.680
Xixiao.

18:23.410 --> 18:25.210
What are you looking at? Only me.

18:26.400 --> 18:27.930
He's sick, didn't you know?

18:29.870 --> 18:30.960
No way.

18:31.160 --> 18:32.490
You guys live together!

18:34.510 --> 18:35.400
I've been taking care of

18:35.400 --> 18:36.350
Grandma these past few days.

18:36.350 --> 18:37.810
I haven't seen him at home.

18:37.980 --> 18:39.380
I thought he wasn't home.

18:40.680 --> 18:41.570
Unbelievable.

18:42.140 --> 18:43.310
You are close to each other

18:43.310 --> 18:45.640
yet pretending each other doesn't exist.

19:01.670 --> 19:02.450
Ms. Chen.

19:02.790 --> 19:03.510
Wan.

19:03.850 --> 19:05.010
I bought something.

19:05.640 --> 19:06.640
He might like it.

19:07.490 --> 19:08.490
Exactly.

19:08.510 --> 19:10.450
He hasn't eaten any food today

19:10.750 --> 19:12.430
and hasn't taken his medicine either.

19:12.430 --> 19:13.550
Take it to him.

19:15.290 --> 19:16.870
He won't let me in.

19:17.200 --> 19:18.310
No.

19:19.030 --> 19:20.640
He agreed to let you move in.

19:20.640 --> 19:22.840
There's no reason
he wouldn't want to see you.

19:22.840 --> 19:25.100
After all, I'm not the one
he wants to see.

19:25.470 --> 19:26.160
Come on.

19:26.440 --> 19:28.170
Take the medicine to him too.

19:28.550 --> 19:29.030
Go.

19:30.990 --> 19:31.440
Go.

19:36.600 --> 19:37.270
What's the matter?

19:37.270 --> 19:38.200
Didn't you just leave?

19:38.200 --> 19:39.160
Why are you back?

19:39.920 --> 19:40.750
It's me.

19:46.100 --> 19:46.870
Come in.

19:54.800 --> 19:57.400
I packed
some Three-Delicacy noodles for you.

19:57.960 --> 19:59.050
Eat some.

20:03.770 --> 20:05.100
Finally, you showed up.

20:11.750 --> 20:13.280
I thought you were mad at me.

20:16.070 --> 20:17.680
You were afraid I was mad,

20:17.680 --> 20:19.010
so you didn't come here?

20:27.100 --> 20:27.890
Fine.

20:28.060 --> 20:29.720
It can be counted as an excuse.

20:30.410 --> 20:32.270
Fine, just consider me being mad.

20:34.050 --> 20:35.590
You aren't mad.

21:17.570 --> 21:19.300
You need to take your medicine.

21:26.600 --> 21:28.060
Remember to turn up the AC.

21:28.510 --> 21:29.990
Cover yourself tightly with the blanket,

21:29.990 --> 21:30.750
sweat it out,

21:31.510 --> 21:33.370
and rest well for a couple of days.

21:37.160 --> 21:38.220
I'm going back now.

21:40.340 --> 21:40.930
Wait.

21:48.030 --> 21:48.960
You're leaving?

21:52.600 --> 21:53.800
Ruthless.

21:54.150 --> 21:56.080
How do you think I caught this cold?

21:57.370 --> 21:58.200
That day on the mountain,

21:58.200 --> 21:59.920
I wanted to go back and pick you up.

21:59.920 --> 22:02.650
But when I got there,
you were nowhere to be found.

22:05.260 --> 22:07.210
Then, I'll stay with you a bit longer.

22:07.210 --> 22:08.340
Take your medicine.

22:17.520 --> 22:23.890
[Jiang Yan sent you a new message.]

22:27.120 --> 22:27.880
Are you okay?

22:28.200 --> 22:30.230
He didn't give you a hard time, did he?

22:30.230 --> 22:30.880
No.

22:32.040 --> 22:32.870
Don't worry.

22:34.560 --> 22:36.760
Are you coming back in the next few days?

22:56.640 --> 22:57.960
You said you'd keep me company,

22:57.960 --> 22:59.220
but you're quite busy.

23:05.840 --> 23:07.040
I didn't do anything.

23:07.370 --> 23:08.500
This is my phone.

23:16.500 --> 23:17.430
What do you mean?

23:18.290 --> 23:19.620
You made me catch a cold.

23:21.400 --> 23:22.560
You're keeping me company,

23:22.560 --> 23:24.290
and brought me food and drinks.

23:25.090 --> 23:26.820
I haven't seen your sincerity.

23:28.350 --> 23:30.060
Then, what should I do?

23:29.330 --> 23:30.840
♪ Warm fish tank ♪

23:31.950 --> 23:33.330
♪ Glasses grow ♪

23:34.280 --> 23:35.690
♪ Drowning at dusk ♪

23:37.060 --> 23:38.900
♪ You came to save me ♪

23:37.490 --> 23:38.890
Let's share weal and woe.

23:38.930 --> 23:40.590
♪ Just like that ♪

23:41.910 --> 23:45.670
♪ You said it was a weird dream ♪

23:42.200 --> 23:43.600
I'll pass the cold to you.

23:47.270 --> 23:50.140
♪ The sense of deja vu came suddenly♪

23:51.870 --> 23:55.190
♪ 2013, 16 times faster ♪

23:56.660 --> 24:00.750
♪ The night is like a window
and the night is like the ocean ♪

24:01.670 --> 24:05.860
♪ Just like all the memories ♪

24:08.070 --> 24:08.850
So annoying.

24:11.190 --> 24:12.790
Remember to eat the noodles.

24:12.990 --> 24:13.720
I'm leaving.

24:28.270 --> 24:28.840
Come in.

24:37.310 --> 24:38.550
I hope you like it.

24:44.170 --> 24:45.650
It's from Miss Zhou.

24:50.290 --> 24:50.940
Okay.

24:52.330 --> 24:53.390
I'll be going then.

25:21.990 --> 25:22.790
Morning.

25:23.630 --> 25:24.280
Morning.

25:24.850 --> 25:26.320
Are you over your cold?

25:26.680 --> 25:27.410
Much better,

25:27.930 --> 25:28.850
thanks to you.

25:30.640 --> 25:31.440
That's great.

25:31.640 --> 25:32.700
Come on, let's eat.

25:33.200 --> 25:34.930
You finally look like a family.

25:35.580 --> 25:36.510
Sit, Xixiao.

25:37.230 --> 25:38.630
I'm full. I'll get going.

25:38.670 --> 25:40.330
So early. Where are you going?

25:40.360 --> 25:41.420
To admire the moon.

25:41.710 --> 25:42.310
Admire...

25:45.150 --> 25:46.020
Ms. Chen.

25:47.640 --> 25:49.100
Why are you in such a hurry?

25:49.770 --> 25:51.840
Xixiao went to see Professor Qin today.

25:51.840 --> 25:54.030
He said he needed to bring his portfolio,

25:54.030 --> 25:56.350
but I found his drawing left on the table.

25:56.370 --> 25:57.990
He must have forgot it.

25:58.550 --> 26:00.280
Don't worry. I'll deliver it to him.

26:00.280 --> 26:01.390
Slow down.

26:03.960 --> 26:04.620
Professor.

26:05.600 --> 26:06.930
I want to hear the truth.

26:07.030 --> 26:07.750
Where exactly is my drawing

26:07.750 --> 26:08.680
not good enough?

26:08.880 --> 26:09.680
Are you sure?

26:10.350 --> 26:12.170
It might be a blow to you.

26:12.880 --> 26:13.910
Absolutely not.

26:14.310 --> 26:15.570
So confident?

26:16.100 --> 26:17.880
If I didn't want to hear the truth,

26:17.880 --> 26:19.160
I'd probably still
be on the mountain road,

26:19.160 --> 26:21.420
racing my bike and gambling with my life.

26:23.110 --> 26:24.710
Are the ones you brought today

26:24.710 --> 26:26.100
all of your works?

26:26.920 --> 26:27.480
Yes.

26:28.360 --> 26:29.710
You paint very well.

26:29.840 --> 26:30.640
To be honest,

26:30.660 --> 26:33.210
you won't have much trouble
with your application.

26:33.210 --> 26:35.790
But I have no interest

26:35.820 --> 26:37.070
in tutoring you.

26:37.440 --> 26:39.550
Because I don't think I can help you.

26:39.860 --> 26:41.690
How could you not help me?

26:41.880 --> 26:43.160
Professor Qin, if you

26:43.160 --> 26:44.360
were my tutor,

26:44.360 --> 26:45.750
it would be extremely helpful.

26:45.750 --> 26:46.030
Professor Qin.

26:46.030 --> 26:46.840
Because I don't know

26:46.840 --> 26:48.030
how to help you.

26:48.880 --> 26:49.990
You've been painting

26:49.990 --> 26:51.680
what your mother used to paint,

26:51.680 --> 26:52.410
haven't you?

26:58.940 --> 27:00.120
You are very smart,

27:00.440 --> 27:01.700
just like your mother.

27:01.720 --> 27:04.500
But all I see is copying.

27:04.790 --> 27:06.880
I can't see where you are.

27:07.920 --> 27:08.710
What you

27:08.710 --> 27:10.170
want to express deep down,

27:10.250 --> 27:11.740
and your inner feelings

27:12.030 --> 27:13.400
are not reflected at all

27:13.420 --> 27:14.510
in your works.

27:16.180 --> 27:17.040
Professor Qin.

27:17.160 --> 27:18.710
Well, I can prepare again.

27:18.710 --> 27:19.570
Professor Qin.

27:20.420 --> 27:21.280
How about that?

27:22.070 --> 27:24.070
Come to me again at the end of the month.

27:24.070 --> 27:25.530
I'll let you know the time.

27:25.630 --> 27:28.390
But this is your last chance.

27:28.560 --> 27:29.910
Okay, I understand.

27:30.140 --> 27:31.000
Professor Qin.

27:31.550 --> 27:32.160
Well,

27:32.390 --> 27:35.220
then what do you think

27:35.250 --> 27:36.390
I should draw?

27:36.920 --> 27:37.980
It's quite simple.

27:38.770 --> 27:41.390
Creation is nothing more than expression.

27:41.520 --> 27:43.200
Express your thoughts,

27:43.230 --> 27:44.640
your feelings,

27:44.660 --> 27:46.070
your mind,

27:46.090 --> 27:47.500
your emotions,

27:47.600 --> 27:48.920
and your inner world.

27:49.150 --> 27:50.780
What do you want the most?

27:50.890 --> 27:52.820
What are you most afraid of losing?

27:53.470 --> 27:55.360
The only difference is whether

27:55.440 --> 27:58.030
you have the courage to face yourself.

27:59.790 --> 28:01.270
You are not a stupid kid.

28:01.420 --> 28:03.220
I think you understand my words.

28:03.920 --> 28:04.720
I understand.

28:06.570 --> 28:07.160
But

28:09.380 --> 28:11.180
I feel like what I want to express

28:11.550 --> 28:12.810
only exists in dreams.

28:13.280 --> 28:15.460
Dreams are a good way to express.

28:15.980 --> 28:19.180
The question is, what does that dream

28:19.300 --> 28:20.540
mean to you?

29:10.810 --> 29:12.890
I can't see where you are.

29:14.010 --> 29:16.030
What you want to express,

29:16.590 --> 29:18.100
and your inner feelings

29:18.440 --> 29:19.600
are not reflected at all

29:19.600 --> 29:20.640
in your work.

29:21.580 --> 29:25.910
♪ Should I chase freedom all alone ♪

29:25.170 --> 29:27.280
What do you think I should paint?

29:26.910 --> 29:29.860
♪ Find an excuse, heed what I've known ♪

29:28.640 --> 29:29.930
Express your heart,

29:30.070 --> 29:31.310
your emotions,

29:31.330 --> 29:32.810
and your inner feelings.

29:31.450 --> 29:34.000
♪ Every time I stop and stay ♪

29:33.020 --> 29:34.700
What you want the most?

29:34.160 --> 29:36.070
♪ For reasons that fade away ♪

29:35.120 --> 29:36.280
You know it clearly.

29:37.800 --> 29:41.860
♪ Are you out there waiting for me ♪

29:43.180 --> 29:45.930
♪ Through the dark, bravely, steadily ♪

29:46.850 --> 29:50.500
♪ If I could run and land with you ♪

29:52.820 --> 29:56.110
♪ After the long night ♪

29:57.480 --> 29:59.680
♪ I'll find my way, no more lost inside ♪

30:00.620 --> 30:04.160
♪ Thinking about ♪

30:05.400 --> 30:08.940
♪ Fulfilling the last promise ♪

30:11.200 --> 30:13.250
♪ We've both held fragility ♪

30:13.310 --> 30:14.690
♪ Talked through our misery ♪

30:14.810 --> 30:17.890
♪ This time
I'm holding tight to your will ♪

30:19.030 --> 30:21.070
♪ Lighting up all the sparks ♪

30:21.190 --> 30:23.790
♪ Hoping it doesn't slip away ♪

30:25.570 --> 30:26.230
What are you doing?

30:26.230 --> 30:27.700
Are you fishing?

30:29.910 --> 30:30.570
Is it sweet?

30:31.640 --> 30:33.330
Isn't this just a sugar substitute?

30:33.330 --> 30:34.490
You're trying to fool me again.

30:34.490 --> 30:36.230
The sugar substitute is still sugar.

30:36.230 --> 30:36.960
I heard from the doctor

30:36.960 --> 30:38.750
that the medicine you took recently
is a bit bitter.

30:38.750 --> 30:39.440
After taking your medicine,

30:39.440 --> 30:41.440
hold it in your mouth and spit it out.

30:41.440 --> 30:43.440
It will make your mouth feel better.

30:43.720 --> 30:45.370
Do not worry about me,

30:45.400 --> 30:46.070
okay?

30:46.470 --> 30:47.840
You are about to retake your Grade 12.

30:47.840 --> 30:48.790
Mind

30:48.810 --> 30:50.140
your own business.

30:50.880 --> 30:53.040
With my grades,
what's there to worry about?

30:53.040 --> 30:54.440
Not to mention paying tuition,

30:54.440 --> 30:55.880
there are many schools

30:55.880 --> 30:56.880
inviting me

30:56.880 --> 30:58.010
with scholarships.

30:58.470 --> 31:00.380
I know you are smart

31:00.470 --> 31:01.920
and excellent.

31:02.840 --> 31:04.800
But I feel sorry for you.

31:05.880 --> 31:07.750
Look at other kids,

31:08.120 --> 31:09.880
all they have to do

31:09.880 --> 31:10.880
is studying hard.

31:11.360 --> 31:13.200
But besides that, you

31:13.310 --> 31:14.750
have to worry about me.

31:18.490 --> 31:19.990
I just hope

31:20.820 --> 31:22.950
that everything goes smoothly for you

31:22.990 --> 31:24.880
after you retake your year.

31:26.360 --> 31:27.710
I don't dare expect

31:27.710 --> 31:28.740
your life to be

31:29.070 --> 31:30.120
successful

31:30.780 --> 31:32.320
or spectacular.

31:33.070 --> 31:34.390
But I hope

31:34.680 --> 31:36.750
even if your life is ordinary

31:36.750 --> 31:38.050
and plain,

31:38.400 --> 31:41.960
you can live kindly and happily.

31:45.710 --> 31:46.510
Grandma.

31:48.840 --> 31:50.880
What makes a person kind?

31:52.090 --> 31:54.320
You are already very kind.

32:15.990 --> 32:16.990
Hello, Jiang Yan.

32:21.650 --> 32:23.460
I need your help with something.

32:25.070 --> 32:25.800
Is that okay?

32:27.580 --> 32:36.840
[Lingshan Welfare House]

32:57.080 --> 32:57.880
Mr. Lu,

32:58.160 --> 32:58.920
did you make an appointment

32:58.920 --> 33:00.450
to volunteer at 10 o'clock?

33:04.460 --> 33:05.030
Yes.

33:10.930 --> 33:12.460
Please register here then.

33:13.200 --> 33:14.360
We have already

33:14.360 --> 33:15.160
arranged for a volunteer

33:15.160 --> 33:16.400
to guide you.

33:16.460 --> 33:17.440
Don't worry.

33:17.880 --> 33:18.880
Where is Zhou Wan?

33:19.440 --> 33:20.310
She is with the children

33:20.310 --> 33:21.710
for morning activities.

33:22.780 --> 33:24.240
I am your guide today.

33:24.680 --> 33:26.270
I come to this orphanage often.

33:26.270 --> 33:27.710
I am very familiar with this place.

33:27.710 --> 33:28.360
If you have any questions,

33:28.360 --> 33:28.960
you can ask me.

33:28.960 --> 33:30.030
Yan.

33:31.600 --> 33:32.360
Go back to the classroom first.

33:32.360 --> 33:33.120
We'll play together later,

33:33.120 --> 33:33.680
okay?

33:33.750 --> 33:34.310
Okay.

33:41.510 --> 33:42.200
Lu Xixiao.

33:48.230 --> 33:50.560
I was wrong about what happened last time.

33:51.510 --> 33:52.120
It's Zhou Wan's freedom

33:52.120 --> 33:53.190
to choose whom she wants to

33:53.190 --> 33:54.310
get along with.

33:54.680 --> 33:56.340
I shouldn't have interfered.

33:56.840 --> 33:57.440
And I shouldn't have

33:57.440 --> 33:58.680
dragged her into

33:59.030 --> 34:00.270
our issues.

34:01.700 --> 34:03.160
Don't let her down.

34:06.640 --> 34:07.790
Please lead the way,

34:07.950 --> 34:08.760
Mr. Jiang.

34:13.350 --> 34:14.880
Zhou Wan thought this place

34:14.969 --> 34:17.100
might help you find some inspiration.

34:19.100 --> 34:20.540
Most of the kids here

34:20.630 --> 34:24.050
[Bei Bei]

34:20.739 --> 34:22.170
are reclusive.

34:22.690 --> 34:24.550
But after spending some time with them,

34:24.550 --> 34:25.550
you will discover

34:25.230 --> 34:30.790
[Bathroom]

34:25.550 --> 34:26.550
their innocence.

34:27.550 --> 34:28.920
If you encounter any difficult ones,

34:28.920 --> 34:30.920
just come to me and Zhou Wan anytime.

34:32.150 --> 34:33.150
How hard can it be?

34:34.659 --> 34:36.489
[Health Room]

34:34.889 --> 34:36.570
The tiger is hunting.

34:36.600 --> 34:37.800
The deer and the piglet

34:37.800 --> 34:39.469
quickly escape into the dense forest.

34:38.690 --> 34:42.760
[Health Room]

34:40.239 --> 34:40.920
Oh no!

34:40.920 --> 34:42.489
The old man fell down!

34:43.780 --> 34:46.130
Which one is the old man?

34:44.699 --> 34:46.190
[Health Room]

34:48.380 --> 34:50.050
Read by yourself for a while.

34:50.170 --> 34:52.030
I'll come keep you company later.

34:52.870 --> 34:53.400
Sit here.

34:56.969 --> 35:02.930
[Health Room]

34:58.180 --> 34:59.710
I didn't expect you to come.

35:01.490 --> 35:03.350
I had nothing better to do anyway.

35:03.800 --> 35:05.150
How about you interact

35:05.150 --> 35:06.280
with the kids first?

35:09.580 --> 35:10.710
Everyone, look!

35:11.070 --> 35:11.720
Today, we have

35:11.720 --> 35:13.180
a new brother visiting us.

35:14.170 --> 35:15.800
Introduce yourself to them.

35:19.250 --> 35:22.430
[Health Room]

35:34.760 --> 35:35.470
Start.

35:36.470 --> 35:37.760
Come on, Shengsheng.

35:37.760 --> 35:38.720
Come on!

35:38.740 --> 35:40.470
-Be careful.
-Go! Come on!

35:40.470 --> 35:43.430
Come on! Come on! Come on!

35:43.460 --> 35:44.690
Come on!

35:44.710 --> 35:46.280
-You’re serious.
-Come on!

35:46.280 --> 35:47.400
He's going to lose.

35:48.460 --> 35:49.030
No.

35:52.440 --> 35:53.370
Compete with me.

35:56.460 --> 35:57.790
Wan.

35:57.830 --> 35:59.080
Wan.

35:59.360 --> 36:00.030
Come on.

36:00.030 --> 36:00.440
Get up.

36:00.440 --> 36:02.470
Come on, Wan.

36:02.470 --> 36:04.760
Come on, Wan.

36:05.630 --> 36:06.320
Okay.

36:06.320 --> 36:07.230
I won.

36:08.630 --> 36:09.800
Wan won.

36:11.690 --> 36:12.630
-Didn’t you eat?
-No.

36:12.630 --> 36:13.190
No.

36:13.190 --> 36:14.110
Did you eat?

36:14.110 --> 36:15.320
-No.
-Have you eaten?

36:15.320 --> 36:15.850
No.

36:15.870 --> 36:17.830
-They said you didn’t eat.
-I'll give you chestnut bread.

36:17.830 --> 36:20.000
Dazi didn't eat your bread.

36:20.440 --> 36:21.670
Use more strength.

36:21.840 --> 36:23.290
From then on,

36:23.360 --> 36:25.310
they became best friends

36:24.640 --> 36:28.330
[Cultivate your conduct]

36:25.380 --> 36:26.880
and lived happily

36:26.880 --> 36:28.540
together.

36:30.540 --> 36:31.930
Applaud.

36:31.610 --> 36:35.670
[Cultivate your conduct]

36:33.880 --> 36:35.800
Was Yan's story good?

36:36.360 --> 36:37.880
Yes.

36:37.880 --> 36:39.750
Then, let's thank Yan.

36:39.840 --> 36:43.800
Thank you, Yan.

36:43.800 --> 36:45.150
Next, let's invite

36:45.150 --> 36:46.280
Xixiao to tell us a story.

36:46.280 --> 36:46.960
Okay?

36:48.280 --> 36:49.440
How do you do this?

36:49.440 --> 36:51.360
-I want a sheep.
-Put your fingers inside.

36:51.360 --> 36:52.780
I want one too.

36:53.000 --> 36:53.960
I'll get it for you later.

36:53.960 --> 36:56.220
-I want a lion.
-I'll get it for you later.

36:56.320 --> 36:57.110
We are going to listen to

36:57.110 --> 36:57.990
a new story soon.

36:57.990 --> 37:00.570
Alright, everyone, please be quiet.

37:01.880 --> 37:04.150
Get ready for a new story.

37:06.150 --> 37:07.630
Long time ago.

37:11.590 --> 37:13.590
Long long time ago.

37:16.630 --> 37:18.920
Why is it this sentence again?

37:19.150 --> 37:20.860
It's so boring.

37:27.030 --> 37:28.630
It's boring.

37:28.670 --> 37:30.440
Long long time ago.

37:31.630 --> 37:33.030
Long time ago,

37:34.590 --> 37:36.550
there lived a little sheep

37:36.550 --> 37:39.720
with a very different color in the forest.

37:44.720 --> 37:47.500
She went out to find food

37:47.720 --> 37:50.340
and met a wolf on the way.

37:58.510 --> 37:59.860
I'm scared.

38:00.240 --> 38:01.320
She originally thought

38:01.320 --> 38:02.190
the big wolf was

38:02.210 --> 38:03.570
a very terrifying guy,

38:04.720 --> 38:05.920
but she didn't expect

38:06.500 --> 38:07.320
the big wolf actually

38:07.320 --> 38:08.980
didn't want to hurt her at all.

38:14.710 --> 38:16.140
The big wolf lived

38:16.300 --> 38:18.480
all alone deep in the forest.

38:18.880 --> 38:20.110
He didn't want any small animals

38:20.110 --> 38:21.170
to get close to him,

38:22.240 --> 38:23.230
Because

38:24.030 --> 38:26.050
he looked ugly,

38:27.000 --> 38:28.280
he hid away.

38:35.920 --> 38:37.190
He thought the little black sheep

38:37.190 --> 38:38.720
would be very afraid of him,

38:39.280 --> 38:40.410
but to his surprise,

38:40.880 --> 38:42.390
she wasn't afraid at all.

38:44.060 --> 38:46.320
She was willing to play with the big wolf.

38:47.720 --> 38:48.920
And the two of them

38:48.940 --> 38:50.320
had a lot of fun.

38:52.080 --> 38:54.550
He invited the little black sheep
to his home.

38:54.550 --> 38:55.280
He thought

38:55.280 --> 38:57.540
the little black sheep wouldn't like it,

38:58.070 --> 38:59.150
but unexpectedly,

39:01.150 --> 39:02.680
the little black sheep said

39:03.670 --> 39:06.030
the big wolf's home was

39:06.150 --> 39:08.550
the most beautiful place

39:08.550 --> 39:10.470
she had ever seen.

39:12.760 --> 39:14.070
The two continued

39:14.070 --> 39:15.840
to play together

39:17.440 --> 39:18.960
until it got dark.

39:19.150 --> 39:21.210
The little black sheep had to go home.

39:22.000 --> 39:23.050
Before she left,

39:24.320 --> 39:25.720
the big wolf stopped her.

39:28.950 --> 39:30.610
He wanted to give her a flower.

39:32.070 --> 39:33.030
He picked

39:33.030 --> 39:35.090
a rose he had treasured for a long time

39:35.320 --> 39:37.510
from his garden.

39:39.190 --> 39:41.050
The little black sheep asked why.

39:42.820 --> 39:43.780
Why?

39:45.630 --> 39:47.110
I built a garden

39:47.790 --> 39:49.210
deep in the forest.

39:51.090 --> 39:52.580
Everyone who came

39:54.160 --> 39:56.120
only saw a gloomy path.

40:00.570 --> 40:01.340
Only you

40:02.510 --> 40:03.550
saw roses.

40:06.410 --> 40:07.060
So,

40:10.730 --> 40:12.600
this rose is for you.

40:44.070 --> 40:45.840
Thank you, everyone.

40:45.860 --> 40:47.210
Thank you, everyone.

40:51.000 --> 40:52.520
Let's thank Xixiao

40:52.550 --> 40:53.800
and Wan.

40:54.480 --> 40:56.370
Thank you, Xixiao.

40:56.400 --> 40:58.150
Thank you, Wan.

40:58.150 --> 41:00.210
-You’re welcome.
-It's a good story.

41:35.590 --> 41:36.280
Xinyi,

41:36.500 --> 41:38.140
what did you draw here?

41:38.630 --> 41:39.900
This is a Ferris wheel.

41:40.110 --> 41:41.510
This is a carousel.

41:42.210 --> 41:43.540
What is this one?

41:44.360 --> 41:46.280
This is a bumper car.

41:46.660 --> 41:47.660
What?

41:47.680 --> 41:49.180
Does it not look like it?

41:51.220 --> 41:52.390
Of course not.

41:52.630 --> 41:53.840
You drew it very well.

41:54.630 --> 41:55.670
It's just that

41:55.670 --> 41:57.110
I didn't go to amusement parks much
when I was little,

41:57.110 --> 41:58.910
so I didn't recognize it at once.

41:59.560 --> 42:00.570
That's okay.

42:00.800 --> 42:02.580
Next time on my birthday,

42:02.760 --> 42:04.360
I'll invite you to go with me,

42:04.440 --> 42:05.240
okay?

42:06.280 --> 42:06.950
Okay.

42:31.010 --> 42:32.070
How is it?

42:32.100 --> 42:33.700
Do you have any inspiration?

42:42.080 --> 42:43.080
We worked all day.

42:43.370 --> 42:44.300
I'm quite tired.

42:45.530 --> 42:46.730
I'll get going first.

42:47.940 --> 42:49.470
Do you want to try again?

42:53.220 --> 42:54.060
Next time.

43:17.090 --> 43:19.410
[Lingshan Welfare House]

43:30.940 --> 43:32.000
It didn't work out?

43:37.780 --> 43:40.100
You went through a lot of trouble
to help him.

43:40.100 --> 43:41.100
Why?

43:44.900 --> 43:46.700
There isn't much I can do to help.

43:47.410 --> 43:48.330
Besides,

43:48.970 --> 43:50.100
I owe him this.
